Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.77,0:00:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs18\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(98.4,55.467)}I want to be popular, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.69,0:00:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mogura, I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.33,0:00:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You started match-up, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.89,0:00:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How are things going on the ratings side?
