Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs36\b1\frz15.56\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(164,244.267)}Bio
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.85,0:00:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Total garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.01,0:00:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting a single like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, maybe it's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.77,0:00:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason it's not working out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.09,0:00:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be better if you made \Nyour name sound cooler or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.26,0:00:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see. \NAdding "King Hercules" to your name, for instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs36\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(192.8,78.933)\frz0.1651}King Hercules
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs36\b1\c&H09FF14&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz0.8251\pos(227.2,180.267)}Online
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs36\b1\c&H9237DA&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz359.7\pos(258.4,246.4)}Likes! 0
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.53,0:00:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,King Hercules?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Names that have King Hercules attached to them \Nare the coolest ones, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs25\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(196,24.533)}Note:It's alien prejudice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth boys have all fallen for how cool \Nthat name is at least once, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mogura, you aren't really enough of a \Nking to call yourself King Hercules, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,True, he's barely at a "Prince Hercules" level.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two, could you stop making fun of me \Nbefore I even figure out what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.49,0:00:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking, wouldn't a name that \Nappeals to girls be good too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.85,0:00:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A name that appeals to girls? \NFor example?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Names that end in "-ccino" are pretty popular \Nwith girls, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs36\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz0.1651\pos(135.2,80)}Moguraccino
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs36\b1\c&H09FF14&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz0.8251\pos(232.8,181.333)}Online
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs36\b1\c&H9237DA&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz359.7\pos(258.4,246.4)}Likes! 0
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.21,0:01:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true. 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls love them so much that whenever a new "-ccino" comes out, they rush right out to buy it and post it on SNS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.23,0:01:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs25\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(180.8,24.533)}Note: It's alien prejudice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.32,0:01:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If only Mole had a bit more "-ccino" flavor to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"-ccino" flavor?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it still in time for me to get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.44,0:01:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When it comes to "-ccinos," \Nthere's no such thing as too early or too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The only options are things like matcha \Nor whole banana-style ones anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.92,0:01:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't really get what you're getting at, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best, Mogura. \NNo—King Hercules Moguraccino.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.73,0:01:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs36\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz0.1651\pos(195.2,82.133)}King Hercules Moguraccino
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.73,0:01:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs36\b1\c&H09FF14&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz0.8251\pos(232.8,181.333)}Online
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.73,0:01:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs36\b1\c&H9237DA&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz359.7\pos(258.4,246.4)}Likes! 0
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.75,0:01:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,King Hercules Moguraccino... \NI feel like this could actually work!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs42\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(196.8,104.533)}It wasn't good enough
